  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Aoristo: acciones terminadas",
    "@en": "Aoristo: actions completed"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Χτες** significa ayer. Para una acción terminada, el griego usa el aoristo: **πήγα** (fui), **είδα** (vi), **έφαγα** (comí).",
     "@en": "**Χτες** means yesterday. For a finished action, the Greek uses the aoristo: **πήγα** (I went), **είδα** (vi), **έφαγα** (ate)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Muchas formas de primera persona singular terminan en **-σα**: **αγόρασα** (compré), **μίλησα** (hablé). Aprende cada verbo con una frase corta y su marcador temporal.",
     "@en": "Many forms of first person singular end up in **-σα**: **αγόρασα** (bought), **μίλησα** (spoke). Learn each verb with a short sentence and its time marker."
    }
   ]
  },
